<Issue title="Staying a County Island" heading="Staying a County Island" lead="We like where we live. Many of us chose the county on purpose. We believe residents should decide their own future.">
  <h2>Why it matters to us</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Our community character.</li>
    <li>Our property and our choices.</li>
    <li>Our voice in local decisions.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What we stand for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Island residents decide whether to change status. Not anyone else.</li>
    <li>Services like fire protection should not depend on joining a city.</li>
    <li>Open, honest information about any annexation proposal.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Stay alert</h2>
  <p>If you get mail or a visit about annexation, <a href="/contact/?topic=Annexation">let us know</a>.</p>
</Issue>
